OL,3,ASuspected Hamas member guilty of UK
OL,4,Aknife attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA suspected Hamas member, wanted in
OL,7,FGermany over an alleged plot to murder
OL,8,FJewish people, has been found guilty of
OL,9,Fa knife attack on a bailiff outside his
OL,10,FUK home.
OL,12,FMohammed Alfatih, also known as
OL,13,FMohammed Naim, is reported to have
OL,14,Facted as a bodyguard to the leader of
OL,15,FHamas before being granted asylum in
OL,16,Fthe UK in 2015 and British citizenship
OL,17,Fin 2020.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
